LRC14 PHYSICAL-LIFT / TARGET-DIPOLE INTERSECTION EXACT PROBE
status=FINITE-EXACT typing no-go plus positive packet-macro control
universe=physical_addresses n in Z/4826809Z; target_twists s,t in F_13; abstract projected endpoint residues ubar=eta.u,vbar=eta.v in F_13
type_dictionary=packet_address:n; packet_residue:n_mod_13; carry/root:event labels; s,t:dual target-twist parameters; u,v:global Fourier multiindices; ubar,vbar:abstract target projections; q=ubar-vbar=eta.(u-v)
pointwise_warning=u,v are global Fourier summation indices, not measurable labels of x, a runner, a packet vertex, a carry, or a private root
dipole_equations=blocker*k/R=s/13 and graft*k/R=-s/13 mod 1
pair_sum_derivation=R|(blocker+graft)k and gcd(blocker+graft,R)=1 force k=0, then s=0
all_depth_phase_map=(x,y)->(blocker*x+y,graft*x-y) on C_(13^r)^2 has determinant -(blocker+graft), a 13-adic unit; hence its kernel is trivial for every r>=1
kakeya_reading=the physical diagonal-translation needle and the opposite target-dipole needle are transverse in the two-factor phase torus; deeper 13-adic toothpicks do not create an intersection
neutral_anchor_derivation=guard H=1 forces R|k; even without H, target-neutral c1=13 forces 13^5|k and then each blocker phase is integral, forcing s=0
